{"sourceUrl":"https://sss.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/item/23646.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:34.261228+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sss.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/item/23646.html","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>  为促进全国优秀大学生学术交流，增进青年学生对系统科学相关学科的了解，北京交通大学系统科学学院将举办面向2027级硕士研究生的“暑期夏令营”活动。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span>一、报名条件</span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>  申请者须品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康，并满足以下条件：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>  1. </span></span></span><span><span><span>有志于在本学院交通系统科学与工程研究领域（系统理论与复杂性、复杂交通系统建模与调控、综合交通系统分析与集成、大数据与智能系统）或大数据技术与工程专业硕士方向从事科学研究的应届本科毕业生。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>  2. </span></span></span><span><span><span>本科专业应为相关理学专业（系统科学与工程、数学、统计、物理等）；或交通运输类本科专业，例如交通运输、交通工程、物流工程等；或计算机、自动化、通信工程等工学专业。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>  3. </span></span></span><span><span><span>本校应届本科毕业生，专业成绩排名前40%（前五个学期）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>  4. </span></span></span><span><span><span>同类高校应届本科毕业生，专业成绩排名前40%（前五个学期）（特色班可根据实际情况适当放宽）；</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>  5. </span></span></span><span><span><span>具有相关优势学科的高校应届本科毕业生，专业成绩排名前10%<span>；</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>  6. </span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>参加国际、国内各类重大学科竞赛获全国二等奖以上奖励者（含二等奖），或已批准的第一专利发明人，或以第一作者身份发表A类论文者。奖项、论文或专利内容须与接收专业相同或相近，且成绩无不及格科目的考生，学校和专业排名可适当放宽。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span>二、活动安排</span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  本次夏令营将以线上形式举办。活动日程概览如下，详细安排将于后续通知中公布。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>内容</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>时间</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>方式</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>注意事项</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>报名</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>即日起至7月5日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>通过链接填写报名信息：https://v.wjx.cn/vm/OUf7Xdt.aspx</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>请仔细确认所填写的身份证号、手 机号和电子信箱等个人信息，避免因个人信息填写不准确延误通知及信息获取。若多次提交，将以最后一次提交的内容为准。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>参营确认</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月7日前</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>系统科学学院官网-通知公告</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p> </p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>招生宣讲直播</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月8日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>16:00-18:00</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>线上（中国教育在线）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>具体链接另行通知</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>学科方向介绍</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月9日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9:00-11:30</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>线上（腾讯会议）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>具体链接另行通知</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>综合能力展示</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月9日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>14:00</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>开始</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>线上（腾讯会议）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span>“</span></span></span><span><span><span>综合能力展示”形式为 PPT 汇报，汇报内容包括但不限于本科期间的课程成绩情况、科研参与情 况、科研成果发表、未来研究设想，每位同学汇报时间为 3分钟。<span><span>具体链接另行通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span><span>三、关于2026年暑期夏令营活动的说明与温馨提示</span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>导师详细介绍请参阅学院官网（https://sss.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/），营员可通过其个人主页公布的邮箱与导师取得联系。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>夏令营活动内容</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  本次夏令营面向全国拟通过推免方式报考我院各专业的2027届应届本科毕业生，活动内容包括介绍我院研究生培养特色及学科优势；组织营员与导师团队交流，促进双向了解。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  夏令营为招生宣传活动，不设选拔考核、优秀营员评选及任何形式录取承诺。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  3</span></span></span><span><span><span>、联系方式</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  系统科学学院保留对夏令营活动的解释权，学院简介及学科介绍等更多相关信息请查阅网站<a href=\"https://sss.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://sss.bjtu.edu.cn/cms/</span></a>。咨询邮箱：xtyjs@bjtu.edu.cn 咨询电话：010-51683631。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div></div>\n</div>","textSha256":"232b4826bbb856a6d1eeab124f0090b5849a74c3315d99adb00fa77d3560aec0","textLength":1214,"sourceSha256":"607e8d142bee0a813a9eae834b4135d52cb4c63c5796f51bcf891a78999a1b98","selector":".article-content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-64edd813a3abca212ace","title":"2026年北京交通大学系统科学学院2026年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:34.261228+00:00"}
